## Original Content
"O financiamento PRR terminou, ainda estamos a aguardar as medidas nacionais para se lançar uma nova fase de construção de habitação, mas nós já adjudicamos nova construção porque fomos à banca, pedimos empréstimo", afirmou a autarca

## Summary
Matosinhos completes 512 PRR-funded houses with €122 million. Awaiting national measures for new construction phase, the municipality has already secured new construction via bank loan.

## Key Points
- Matosinhos completed 512 houses under the PRR with €122 million financing.
- PRR funding for this project is concluded.
- Municipality awaiting national measures to launch a new housing construction phase.
- Secured bank loan for new construction in anticipation of national measures.


